==Norwegian Nynorsk==

====Pronunciation====
* {{IPA|/soː/|lang=no}}

===Etymology 1===
From {{der|nn|non|svá}}, from {{der|nn|gem-pro|*swa}}, {{m|gem-pro|*swē}}. Akin to {{cog|en|so}}.

====Alternative forms====
* {{l|nn|so}}

====Adverb====
{{head|nn|adverb}}

# {{l|en|so}}
#: {{ux|nn|Dei seier '''så'''.|t='''So''' they say.}}
# {{l|en|that}}
#: {{ux|nn|Eg visste ikkje at dei skulle vera '''så''' mange.|t=I didn't know that they were going to be '''that''' many.}}
# {{l|en|as}}
#: {{ux|nn|'''Så''' vidt eg veit.|t='''As''' far as I know.}}
# [[so#English|then]]
#: {{ux|nn|Eg gjekk på kino. '''Så''' gjekk eg heim.|t=I went to the movies. '''Then''' I went home.}}

====Conjunction====
{{head|nn|conjunction}}

# [[so]]
#: {{ux|nn|Eg barberte meg '''så''' ho skulle synast eg var fin.|t=I shaved '''so''' that she would think I looked nice.}}

=====Derived terms=====
* {{l|nn|så langt}}
* {{l|nn|så langt, så godt}}

===Etymology 2===
From {{der|nn|non|sá}}, from {{der|nn|gem-pro|*sēaną}}, from {{der|nn|ine-pro|*seh₁-}}.

====Verb====
{{nn-verb-3}}

# to [[sow]] (scatter, disperse, or plant seeds)

===References===
* {{R:The Nynorsk Dictionary}}

